/tools/cameo/work/

# Precomputed line-of-sight caches. Regenerated on first load into
# SupportDir/Cache/shadows, keyed on map content + density rules + algorithm
# version, so a committed copy buys nothing — and every editor save or
# --regen-shadows would otherwise add another ~9-25 MB to the packfile forever.
shadows.bin
